          },
          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Mac draw2 service URL. '' → streaming disabled (barcode/QR + Phase-1 only).\nMay be the tailnet draw2 host directly (hub) OR the bucket-bot draw2 PROXY\nbase (`.../api/hub/cards/draw2`) when `authToken` is set (off-tailnet)."
          },
          "internal": false,
          "getter": false,
          "setter": false
        },
        {
          "name": "draw2UrlFallback",
          "type": "string",
          "attribute": "draw-2-url-fallback",
          "reflect": false,
          "mutable": false,
          "required": false,
          "optional": true,
          "complexType": {
            "original": "string",
            "resolved": "string | undefined",
            "references": {}
          },
          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Optional SECONDARY draw2 proxy origin. When set, the scanner probes both\n`draw2Url` and `draw2UrlFallback` in parallel and uses whichever's `/health`\nis reachable — for YGO 245's complementary on/off-tailnet origins (the public\nTailscale Funnel works only OFF the tailnet, `bot.popcorn245.com` only ON it),\nre-selecting live if connectivity flips. Hub omits it → unchanged\nsingle-origin (`draw2Url`) behavior."
          },
          "internal": false,
          "getter": false,
          "setter": false
        },
        {
          "name": "authToken",
          "type": "string",
          "attribute": "auth-token",
          "reflect": false,
          "mutable": false,
          "required": false,
          "optional": true,
          "complexType": {
            "original": "string",
            "resolved": "string | undefined",
            "references": {}
          },
          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Bearer token for the bot-PROXY draw2 mode (off-tailnet): when set, every\ndraw2 health/detect call rides `Authorization: Bearer …` and the\nLocal-Network-Access warm is skipped (the proxy is a normal PUBLIC origin,\nnot a tailnet IP). Omitted (hub / direct-tailnet) → today's behavior."
          },
          "internal": false,
          "getter": false,
          "setter": false
        },
